00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.240
my self-esteem,

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:54.760
you understand me,

00:00:54.761 --> 00:00:55.761
feel safe

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.760
and today this is part of my differentiation strategy.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:00:59.760
Because let's be honest,

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:04.200
he who knows how to differentiate himself need not introduce himself

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.480
and the best way to differentiate yourself

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.080
you know what your story is,

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:08.960
your progress.

00:01:08.961 --> 00:01:11.201
You and I can do exactly the same.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.600
Imagine that we are leaders in marketing business.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:14.120
However,

00:01:14.121 --> 00:01:16.601
